==========================================================================================
[ELECTRICAL AUDIT OF CDONE/AVDD SEQUENCER & 24-PIN BTB 3-WIRE I2S CONTINUITY (ON TOP OF a678be1)]
==========================================================================================
1. Fixed U6_OPT_AVDD Optical Power Sequencer Duty-Cycle Bug (CHK-04_PIN_PWR & Mut-18):
   - Root cause in a678be1: Driving RC filter from Ball D3 (`frame_vsync_1v8`) averaged `1.80V * (48 / 800,000) = 0.108 mV < 0.95V (VIH)`, shutting off `AVDD_OPT_BIAS` in user mode.
   - Fix: `U6_OPT_AVDD.EN` is charged from `1V8_OPT_VDD` (`1.80V` DC) via `R_SEQ = 100 kOhm + C_SEQ = 220 nF` (`tau = 22.0 ms`) and clamped to `FPGA_CRESET_B` via Schottky diode `D_SEQ (RB521S-30, Vf = 0.22V)`:
       * When `FPGA_CRESET_B = 0V`: `V_EN = 0.22V <= 0.40V (VIL)` -> strictly OFF (`0.00V` via 120-Ohm active discharge).
       * After `FPGA_CRESET_B = 1.80V`: `t_EN = 22.0 ms * ln((1.80 - 0.22)/(1.80 - 0.95)) = 13.64 ms` (`+9.84 ms` after `3.80 ms` Target SPI config completes).
       * Steady state: `V_EN = 1.80V DC` (100% duty cycle); reset/power-down discharge `< 5 us`.

2. Fixed 24-Pin BTB (`J_BTB_L` / `J_BRIDGE_IN`) <-> 16-Pin BTB (`J_BTB_R`) 3-Wire Stereo I2S Mapping (CHK-07 & Mut-19):
   - Eliminated single-pin `S3_I2S_MUX_1V8` truncation on `J_BTB_L`.
   - Assigned `J_BTB_L` / `J_BRIDGE_IN` `Pins 22, 23, 24` to `I2S_BCLK_1V8`, `I2S_LRCLK_1V8`, `I2S_DOUT_1V8` (using `Pin 5` + 4x `3.0A` `MP1..MP4` shield nails tied to `FPC_BRIDGE` L2 solid GND plane), matching `J_BTB_R` `Pins 10, 11, 12` 1-for-1.
   - `19/19` Negative Fault Injections (CHK-08): 100% CAUGHT -> PASS.
